{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（11日）清晨近7時，警方接獲大圍美田路25-35號美松苑有保安員報案，指發現其同事在上址暈倒。救援人員接報到場，發現一名姓陳（46歲）的男保安員昏迷不醒，他由救護車送往威爾斯親王醫院治理。男子暈倒原因仍有待調查。</p><figure><img alt=\"一名姓陳（46歲）的男保安員昏迷不醒，他由救護車送往威爾斯親王醫院治理。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186579113062699008578136.jpeg/S45agy7D681RT4AT_0LwAj0JJUjlglfVOcz-aznM_ms\"/><figcaption>一名姓陳（46歲）的男保安員昏迷不醒，他由救護車送往威爾斯親王醫院治理。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T01:09:50.913414+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T00:57:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T01:03:22.475080+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T01:03:22.475080+00:00","content_hash":"8a214339c1db25df181c401876dbc4e5b5984f58fcc61467124a06d5c4b6f5f6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}